  "description": "*\"From today on, I will never see you again.\"*\n\nHelena, abandoned by her husband on their wedding day, is about to break the vicious bond. But just as she's about to sever ties, her and her husband's bodies switch.\n\n *\"One year from now. If you don't reconnect your fate, you will die as the natural course of events dictates.\"*\n\nWith this profound prophecy, the fates of the two begin to waver.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
